proton-autogen (2.4.5) noble; urgency=medium

  * Added desktop application profile
    - WinRAR
    - 7-Zip
    - Notepad++
    - Foobar2000
    - VLC
    - PuTTY

  * Added dedicated UT3 profile
    - Unreal Tournament 3 stability improvements
    - Improved DXVK compatibility for UE3/D3D9 games

  * Improved executable detection
    - Better classification of launchers, desktop applications,
      DX11/DX12 games, and legacy titles
    - Improved handling of ambiguous executable names

  * Improved environment isolation
    - Prevent environment variable leakage between profiles
    - Separate launcher, desktop, modern game, UE3, and legacy environments

  * Improved legacy game support
    - Enhanced WineD3D configuration for DX8/DX9 titles
    - Improved Unreal Tournament 99 compatibility

  * Stability improvements
    - Improved Battle.net, EA App, and Ubisoft Connect support
    - Fixed profile conflicts affecting some D3D9 applications

  * Compatibility improvements
    - Improved GE-Proton support
    - Better DXVK and VKD3D-Proton integration

  * Technical improvements
    - Refined ESYNC/FSYNC handling
    - Reduced unnecessary Vulkan and DXVK environment overrides

  * Added legacy application profile
    - Improved compatibility with older software such as
      Photoshop and ImageReady

